⚠️ **WORK IN PROGRESS**: This PR partially addresses the styling issues but requires additional architectural decisions.

The CRM example deployed to Vercel with incomplete styles due to missing Tailwind CSS v4 configuration and a deeper monorepo CSS architecture issue.

## Changes Made

**Added Tailwind v4 build configuration:**
- Created `postcss.config.js` with `@tailwindcss/postcss` plugin
- Added `@source` directives to `index.css` to scan all relevant packages:
  - `./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` - CRM app source
  - `../../packages/components/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` - Component library
  - `../../packages/layout/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` - Layout components
  - `../../packages/fields/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` - Form fields
  - `../../packages/react/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` - React renderers (ADDED)
  - `../../packages/plugin-dashboard/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` - Dashboard widgets
- Added `@theme` directive to map CSS variables to Tailwind theme tokens
- Added `@plugin 'tailwindcss-animate'` for component animations
- Added `tailwindcss-animate` and `@tailwindcss/postcss` dev dependencies
- Added Shadcn Sidebar CSS variables (`--sidebar`, `--sidebar-foreground`, `--sidebar-border`, etc.)

## Known Issue

**Styling is still incomplete** due to a Tailwind v4 + monorepo architecture limitation:

- The `@object-ui/components` package builds a complete **115KB CSS file** with all Shadcn UI component styles
- The CRM app only generates **15KB CSS** with basic utilities
- **Root cause**: Tailwind v4 doesn't properly merge CSS from multiple packages that each have `@import 'tailwindcss'`
- Vite aliases point to source files (for HMR), preventing import of pre-built component CSS in production builds
- Shadcn Sidebar component classes aren't being generated despite scanning source files

## Current State

![Current state - styling still incomplete](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/197587ed-985f-40e3-925c-e8147fab611f)

Navigation remains unstyled, sidebar has no background/borders, component placeholders visible.

## Next Steps - Decision Needed

Options to complete the fix:
1. **Modify Vite config** to allow importing pre-built CSS (`@object-ui/components/dist/index.css`)
2. **Copy component CSS** - Duplicate all Shadcn theme/component CSS variables to CRM app
3. **Restructure monorepo CSS** - Centralize CSS generation or change how packages export styles

Awaiting guidance on preferred approach for this monorepo.

## Code Example

```css
@import 'tailwindcss';

/* Scan sources for Tailwind classes */
@source './src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
@source '../../packages/components/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
@source '../../packages/react/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
/* ... */

/* Tailwind plugin for animations */
@plugin 'tailwindcss-animate';

/* Define theme colors for Tailwind 4 */
@theme {
  --color-border: hsl(var(--border));
  --color-sidebar: hsl(var(--sidebar));
  /* ... */
}
```

